# Dashboards missing display_name / warehouse_id must be reported even when the
# resource key contains characters that are path syntax ("[", ","). The required-field
# check looks the dashboard up by path, so a key that does not survive being turned
# into a path string would silently drop these errors.
#
# Each key is in its own target: with both in one config the errors are reported in
# a nondeterministic order.
errcode trace $CLI bundle validate -t bracket
errcode trace $CLI bundle validate -t comma
